  << /ActualText (\042 Own post\055purchase controls for 200M\053 Prime members on Your Orders\054 Amazon\031s \0432 most visited page\n\042 Define extensible patterns and primitives for away teams\054 aligned with research\054 content strategy and legal\n\042 Ship every design as a controlled experiment\054 measured on revenue up\054 contacts and concessions down\n\042 Find upstream fixes for the doorstep handoff moment\054 so deliveries fit into customers\031 lives\054 not our operations\n\042 Prototype in code and synthesize large data sets with AI\073 write reusable skills\054 share new learnings with team)
